Session #64 emergency kill-switch (created 2026-05-09 12:38).

Reason: process_watchdog_v2.py had two bugs causing 5-min restart loop on
5/9 → daily_predict / race_auto_notify spawned every 5 min → "8 messages"
Discord spam each cycle.

Bugs (fixed in same commit):
  1. process_match used backslash 'tools\\X.py' but actual cmdline is
     'tools/X.py' (POSIX) → process_alive() always returned False even
     when 12 race_auto_notify processes were running.
  2. (alive=False, stale=False) was bucketed as MISSING and triggered
     restart, but it actually means "one-shot finished normally + log
     fresh" → COMPLETED status, no restart.

Remove this file ONLY when:
  - You verified the watchdog logic is sound on next race day
  - 5/16 morning (土) は再有効化可能か手動確認
  - Admin で `schtasks /Change /TN "\ProcessWatchdog" /ENABLE` 不要 (Disable してない)

Touch to disable, delete to re-enable.
